# Policy page text. Square-bracketed parts are decisions still to fill in.
POLICIES = [('privacy.html', 'Privacy Policy', 'How ADV Supplies collects, uses and protects your personal information.', [('p', 'This policy explains how ADV Garden and Building Supplies Pty Ltd (ABN [ABN]) ("ADV Supplies", "we", "us") handles personal information. We follow the Australian Privacy Principles in the <i>Privacy Act 1988</i> (Cth).'), ('h', 'What we collect'), ('ul', ['Your name, phone number and email address', 'Your delivery address, delivery date and site notes (such as where to tip and gate codes)', 'Your order history and what you bought', "Payment details, which are entered on Square's secure checkout. We never see or store your full card number.", 'If you sign up to our emails: your email address and which emails you open']), ('h', 'Why we collect it'), ('ul', ['To take your order, deliver it and send you a receipt', 'To contact you about your delivery, including on the day', 'To answer questions and handle returns or complaints', 'To keep the records the law requires, such as tax records', 'To send you offers and news, only if you have agreed. You can unsubscribe at any time.']), ('h', 'Who we share it with'), ('p', 'We only share what each service needs to do its job:'), ('ul', ['Square, which processes payments and keeps our sales records', 'Detrack, which our drivers use to see and complete deliveries', 'Google, which helps you search for and confirm your address', 'Make, which passes order details between these systems', 'HubSpot, which sends our emails if you have signed up', 'Our accountants and IT providers, and government agencies when the law requires it']), ('p', 'Some of these providers store data outside Australia, including in the United States. We choose providers that protect data to a standard similar to the Australian Privacy Principles. We never sell your personal information.'), ('h', 'Keeping it safe'), ('p', 'We use secure, password-protected systems and limit access to staff who need it. We keep records only as long as we need them for the reasons above or as the law requires.'), ('h', 'Seeing or correcting your information'), ('p', 'You can ask to see the information we hold about you, or ask us to correct it. Contact us using the details below and we will reply within 30 days.'), ('h', 'Complaints'), ('p', 'If you are unhappy with how we handled your information, tell us first and we will try to fix it. If you are still not satisfied, you can contact the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner at oaic.gov.au.'), ('h', 'Contact'), ('p', 'Questions? Call us on <a href="tel:0397996399">(03) 9799 6399</a>, email <a href="mailto:sales@advsupplies.com.au">sales@advsupplies.com.au</a> or visit the yard at 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park VIC 3976.'), ('p', 'Last updated: [21 November 2026]')], 'How ADV Supplies collects, uses and protects your personal information.'), ('terms.html', 'Terms &amp; Conditions of Sale', 'The terms that apply when you order from ADV Supplies online, by phone or at the yard.', [('h', '1. Orders and prices'), ('ul', ['All prices are in Australian dollars and include GST.', 'Bulk materials are priced per cubic metre (m³) and sold in quarter-metre steps. For 10 m³ or more, call us for bulk pricing.', 'Your order is confirmed once payment goes through. We will contact you if an item is unavailable and offer a swap or a refund for that item.', 'We may correct obvious pricing errors before your order is delivered or collected.']), ('h', '2. Delivery'), ('ul', ["Delivery is charged at a flat rate per truck load, based on your suburb's delivery zone. One truck carries up to 10 m³ of one material, or two materials in separate compartments.", 'The minimum bulk delivery is 1 m³. For less, you can pick up from the yard.', 'We deliver Monday to Saturday. We will do our best to deliver on the day you choose, but times can change due to weather, traffic or breakdowns. We will let you know if your delivery is delayed.', 'Our trucks are insured to stay on the road. We tip on your driveway, crossover or nature strip only. We cannot drive onto lawns, into backyards or onto soft ground.', 'You are responsible for clear, safe access for a heavy truck: no low wires, overhanging branches, parked cars or narrow gates in the way, and enough room for the tray to lift.', 'When you order, you choose where we tip: your driveway, crossover or nature strip. You are responsible for choosing a spot that is safe and suitable for the load.', 'If you ask our driver to tip somewhere else, or somewhere that turns out to be unsafe or unsuitable, you accept responsibility for any damage, injury or extra cost that results. Our driver may still decline to tip where they believe it is unsafe.', 'A loaded truck is heavy. We take care, but we are not responsible for damage to driveways, kerbs, paving or underground pipes on the spot you choose for us to tip, unless we caused it through our own negligence.', 'Material is your responsibility once it has been tipped. Please cover it if rain or wind is likely, and keep children away from the pile.']), ('h', '3. Pick up from the yard'), ('ul', ['Collect from 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park during opening hours (8am to 4pm).', 'We load your vehicle or trailer, but you are responsible for not overloading it and for securing the load before you drive away.']), ('h', '4. Natural products'), ('p', 'Mulch, soil, sand, pebbles, rock and firewood are natural products. Colour, size, texture and moisture vary from load to load and may differ from photos. Our material calculator gives an estimate only. Allow a little extra for compaction and settling.'), ('h', '5. Changes and cancellations'), ('ul', ['To change or cancel a delivery, call us before [12pm the day before] delivery and we will refund you in full.', 'Once a load has been loaded or has left the yard, we cannot cancel it. See our Refunds &amp; Returns policy for your options.']), ('h', '6. Your rights'), ('p', 'Our goods and services come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. Nothing in these terms limits those rights. See our Refunds &amp; Returns policy for details.'), ('h', '7. Trade accounts'), ('p', 'Trade account customers are also bound by their trade account agreement. If it conflicts with these terms, the trade account agreement applies.'), ('h', 'Contact'), ('p', 'Questions? Call us on <a href="tel:0397996399">(03) 9799 6399</a>, email <a href="mailto:sales@advsupplies.com.au">sales@advsupplies.com.au</a> or visit the yard at 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park VIC 3976.'), ('p', 'These terms are governed by the laws of Victoria. Last updated: [21 November 2026]')], 'The terms that apply when you order from ADV Supplies online, by phone or at the yard.'), ('refunds.html', 'Refunds &amp; Returns', 'What to do if something is wrong with your order.', [('h', 'If there is a problem with your order'), ('p', 'Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage. You are also entitled to have goods repaired or replaced if they fail to be of acceptable quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure.'), ('p', 'If you received the wrong product, the wrong quantity or faulty goods, call us within [48 hours] of delivery or pick up with your order number and, if you can, a photo. We will put it right with a replacement, a refund or a credit. We may need to inspect the product first.'), ('h', 'Change of mind: bulk materials'), ('p', 'We do not offer refunds if you simply change your mind about bulk materials once they have been loaded or tipped. Loose material cannot be collected and resold. Please check your quantities before ordering, or call us and we will help you work out what you need.'), ('h', 'Change of mind: bagged products, hardware and accessories'), ('ul', ['Return unused items in their original condition and packaging within [30] days with your receipt.', 'We will give you a [refund / exchange / store credit].', 'Not accepted for change of mind: opened bags, cut-to-length items, mixed or tinted products, chemicals that have been opened, and special orders.']), ('h', 'Water tanks'), ('p', 'Check your tank when it is delivered and tell us about any damage within [48 hours]. Change-of-mind returns on tanks are by arrangement and a restocking and freight fee may apply.'), ('h', 'How refunds are paid'), ('p', 'Refunds go back to your original payment method. Card refunds can take 3 to 10 business days to appear, depending on your bank.'), ('h', 'Contact'), ('p', 'Questions? Call us on <a href="tel:0397996399">(03) 9799 6399</a>, email <a href="mailto:sales@advsupplies.com.au">sales@advsupplies.com.au</a> or visit the yard at 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park VIC 3976.'), ('p', 'Last updated: [21 November 2026]')], 'What to do if something is wrong with your ADV Supplies order.'), ('gift-cards.html', 'Gift Card Terms', 'Terms for ADV Supplies gift cards.', [('ul', ['Gift cards are valid for 3 years from the date of purchase. The expiry date is shown on the card or in the email.', 'Use your gift card online or at the yard at 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park, for any product or delivery.', 'Your gift card can be used across more than one purchase until the balance runs out. There is no minimum spend.', 'No fees are charged after purchase. Check your balance any time by calling us or asking at the counter.', 'Gift cards cannot be exchanged for cash, except where the law requires.', 'Treat your gift card like cash. If it is lost or stolen, we cannot replace it unless you have proof of purchase and the balance has not been used.', 'If you return goods bought with a gift card, the refund goes back onto a gift card.', 'Promotional or free vouchers may have different terms, which will be shown on the voucher.']), ('h', 'Contact'), ('p', 'Questions? Call us on <a href="tel:0397996399">(03) 9799 6399</a>, email <a href="mailto:sales@advsupplies.com.au">sales@advsupplies.com.au</a> or visit the yard at 320 Hallam Rd, Hampton Park VIC 3976.'), ('p', 'Last updated: [21 November 2026]')], 'Terms for ADV Supplies gift cards.')]
